      "idea": "Hybrid speed scaling: compute min TTC (as in turn 28) and side‑distance scaling (as in turn 23/24) and combine with front‑gap scaling; also set _STOP_WAIT=1.0, _DETOUR_T=4.0, _DETOUR_ROT=0.8",
